  <prompt>Migrate CreateWorkAssignmentWizard to consume WizardFollowOns and delete its local NextStepsSelectionStep + AssignWorkStep/CreateFollowOnEventStep copies (keep workAssignmentService.ts — it is the canonical service reference).</prompt>
